    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Except digoxin, positive inotropes increase mortality in HF. Inotropic support matters in acute HF with cardiogenic shock; long-term continuous infusions in refractory stage D HFrEF may be used as a bridge to transplant or as palliation."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
